  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5c364ea64bdf614b9dda1453a961805, type: 3}
  m_Name: Week2_Mission9_Dialogue_10
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Ms. Kie
  speechLines:
  - 'What we have here are cubs. '
  - If any of them see them, it is puzzle time for them.
  - Here is a simulation of the Streets of Himik.
  - All they have to do is to scout this area and look for Secubots.
  - "Each secubot will give you a puzzle to complete.\r"
  - "It could be a puzzle in fixing it, reprogramming it, or both.\r"
  - The true test?
  - if any puzzle was failed, they automatically fail this test.
  - Whenever you are ready, dear.
